WEBVTT

00:07.448 --> 00:08.758
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.827 --> 00:10.413
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.482 --> 00:11.931
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.000 --> 00:14.137
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.206 --> 00:17.000
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.068 --> 00:19.000
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.068 --> 00:21.068
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.137 --> 00:23.000
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.068 --> 00:24.896
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.965 --> 00:27.034
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.103 --> 00:29.000
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.068 --> 00:31.034
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.103 --> 00:33.000
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.068 --> 00:34.827
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:34.896 --> 00:37.172
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.241 --> 00:39.034
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.103 --> 00:40.379
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.448 --> 00:42.275
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.344 --> 00:45.034
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.103 --> 00:49.758
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:49.827 --> 00:52.965
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

00:53.034 --> 00:59.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:59.482 --> 01:01.931
- Hello. I am Hans.
- 你好。我是汉斯。

01:02.000 --> 01:05.310
And welcome
to Fishy Fairy Tales.
并欢迎
到鱼腥童话。

01:05.379 --> 01:07.034
Now where were we?
现在我们在哪里？

01:07.103 --> 01:09.413
Oh, yes. Here.
哦是的。这里。

01:09.482 --> 01:11.827
Mm-hmm.
[coughs]
嗯嗯。
[咳嗽]

01:11.896 --> 01:14.310
Und now for a classic fairy tale
现在就来听听经典童话故事吧

01:14.379 --> 01:18.862
called "Snow Yellow
und the Seven Jellies."
名为“雪黄”
和七只果冻。”

01:18.931 --> 01:21.931
"Once upon a time, there was
a happy little prince,
“从前，有一个
一个快乐的小王子，

01:22.000 --> 01:25.103
and his name was Snow Yellow."
他的名字叫黄雪。”

01:25.172 --> 01:27.620
- Hi.
Whoa!
- 你好。
哇！

01:27.689 --> 01:28.862
- Whoopsie-daisy.
- 百日菊。

01:28.931 --> 01:31.137
Get back in there, you cuckoo.
回到那里吧，你这个杜鹃。

01:31.206 --> 01:32.965
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

01:33.034 --> 01:35.344
- "Prince Snow Yellow lived
in a castle
——《黄雪王子住过》
在一座城堡里

01:35.413 --> 01:39.620
with Queen Karen,
his evil Step-Motherboard."
与凯伦女王一起，
his evil Step-Motherboard."

01:39.689 --> 01:42.068
- I'm the villain in this story.
- 我是这个故事中的反派。

01:42.137 --> 01:45.206
Ain't that a hoot?
[cackles]
这不是胡闹吗？
[咯咯笑]

01:45.275 --> 01:47.068
[thunder claps]
[雷鸣般的掌声]

01:47.137 --> 01:50.206
- Our story begins
on a beautiful day
- 我们的故事开始了
在美好的一天

01:50.275 --> 01:51.793
just like any other.
就像其他人一样。

01:51.862 --> 01:55.103
- [humming] [clams cooing]
- [嗡嗡声] [蛤蜊咕咕叫]

01:55.172 --> 01:57.827
- Good morning,
my loyal subjects.
- 早上好，
我忠诚的臣民。

01:57.896 --> 01:59.275
[townsfolk screaming]
[镇民尖叫]

01:59.344 --> 02:00.931
[laughs]
I love you all.
[笑]
我爱你们所有人。

02:01.000 --> 02:03.482
♪ Nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah ♪
♪ 呐，呐，呐，呐 ♪

02:03.551 --> 02:07.586
Here are some priceless
royal jewels for you...
这里有一些无价的
皇家珠宝为您...

02:07.655 --> 02:09.068
- [babbles]
- And you.
- [胡言乱语]
- 还有你。

02:09.137 --> 02:12.517
- Huh.
- And you and you.
- 嗯。
- 还有你和你。

02:12.586 --> 02:15.275
- [honks] Mm.
- [按喇叭] 嗯。

02:15.344 --> 02:18.034
- [gulps] Ah.
- [吞咽]啊。

02:18.103 --> 02:20.000
- ♪ Nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah ♪
- ♪ 呐，呐，呐，呐 ♪

02:20.068 --> 02:20.931
[sputtering]
[溅射]

02:21.000 --> 02:24.448
Hellooo, Wishing Well!
你好，祝好！

02:24.517 --> 02:28.551
- Hellooo, Wishing Well!
- 你好，祝好！

02:28.620 --> 02:30.724
- Ready for our morning duet?
- 准备好我们早上的二重唱了吗？

02:32.034 --> 02:35.137
- ♪ I-I-I'm ready ♪
- ♪ 我-我-我准备好了 ♪

02:35.206 --> 02:36.000
- Ahem.
- 咳咳。

02:36.068 --> 02:38.379
♪ I'm a well-wisher ♪
♪ 我是一个善良的人 ♪

02:38.448 --> 02:40.275
- ♪ I'm a well-wisher ♪
- ♪ 我是一个祝福者 ♪

02:40.344 --> 02:42.482
- ♪ Wishing you well ♪
- ♪ 祝你一切顺利 ♪

02:42.551 --> 02:44.586
- ♪ Wishing you well ♪
- ♪ 祝你一切顺利 ♪

02:44.655 --> 02:45.758
- ♪ Wishing Well? ♪
- ♪ 许愿井？ ♪

02:45.827 --> 02:47.172
- ♪ Yes? ♪
- ♪ 是吗？ ♪

02:47.241 --> 02:49.689
- ♪ I wish you
both: ♪ Well ♪
- ♪ 我祝愿你
两人：♪ 嗯 ♪

02:49.758 --> 02:51.862
- ♪ I wish you well ♪
- ♪ 祝你一切顺利 ♪

02:51.931 --> 02:54.793
♪ Wishes of wishing you well
- [groans]
♪ 祝你一切顺利
- [呻吟]

02:54.862 --> 02:57.758
- ♪ Wishes
of wishing you well ♪
- ♪ 愿望
祝你一切顺利♪

02:57.827 --> 03:00.034
- [grunts]
- ♪ I wish you well ♪
- [咕哝]
- ♪ 祝你一切顺利 ♪

03:00.103 --> 03:02.068
♪ Wishes of wishing you
- [groans]
♪ 祝愿你
- [呻吟]

03:02.137 --> 03:03.275
both: ♪ Wishing you ♪
两人：♪ 祝愿你 ♪

03:06.206 --> 03:07.413
- Ouch.
- 哎哟。

03:07.482 --> 03:09.000
- Snow Yellow!
- 雪黄！

03:09.068 --> 03:13.586
No singing until
I've had my morning update!
直到没有唱歌
我早上更新了！

03:13.655 --> 03:16.758
[beeping, buzzing]
[嘟嘟声，嗡嗡声]

03:19.620 --> 03:21.172
Ah, forget it.
啊，算了。

03:21.241 --> 03:22.344
- Oh.
- 哦。

03:22.413 --> 03:24.689
Sorry, Queen Stepmommy.
对不起，女王继母。

03:24.758 --> 03:25.965
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:28.206 --> 03:31.482
Where is she getting all
of these glass shoes?
她从哪里得到所有
这些玻璃鞋？

03:31.551 --> 03:32.862
- Hey, Prince!
- 嘿，王子！

03:32.931 --> 03:35.724
Start scrubbing
those royal commodes,
开始擦洗
那些皇家马桶，

03:35.793 --> 03:37.896
or you don't eat today.
或者你今天不吃饭。

03:37.965 --> 03:40.310
- Yay, toilet duty!
- 耶，厕所值班！

03:40.379 --> 03:44.689
- Say, why do you look
so square all of a sudden?
- 说吧，你为什么看着
突然这么方？

03:44.758 --> 03:45.965
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

03:46.034 --> 03:49.206
- My big boy edges just grew in.
- 我的大男孩边缘刚刚长出来。

03:49.275 --> 03:50.448
Thanks for noticing.
感谢您的关注。

03:50.517 --> 03:51.689
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

03:51.758 --> 03:53.344
- Oh!
- 哦！

03:55.000 --> 03:58.206
♪ Bye, Queen Stepmommy ♪
♪ 再见，女王继母 ♪

03:58.275 --> 04:00.241
- Ugh!
- 呃！

04:00.310 --> 04:02.448
[wheels squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

04:02.517 --> 04:05.068
Magic mirror on my wall,
我墙上的魔镜，

04:05.137 --> 04:08.000
who's the squarest of them all?
他们中谁是最方的？

04:09.931 --> 04:12.896
- You, my Queen,
are square, 'tis true.
- 你，我的女王，
是正方形的，这是真的。

04:12.965 --> 04:16.379
But Snow Yellow is the squarest,
但雪黄是最方的，

04:16.448 --> 04:18.827
uh, boop-boop-bee-doo.
呃，噗噗噗。

04:18.896 --> 04:20.896
- [groans] I knew it!
- [呻吟]我就知道！

04:20.965 --> 04:22.379
- No, you didn't.
- 不，你没有。

04:22.448 --> 04:24.620
You didn't know anything
until I told...
你什么都不知道
直到我告诉...

04:24.689 --> 04:25.827
what?
什么？

04:26.758 --> 04:28.068
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

04:28.137 --> 04:31.655
If I wanna stay
the squarest in the land,
如果我想留下来
陆地上最方形的地方，

04:31.724 --> 04:36.344
I need to de-squarify
Prince Snow Yellow.
我需要去方形化
黄雪王子。

04:36.413 --> 04:38.275
But how?
但如何呢？

04:38.344 --> 04:40.448
[video game music]
- [gasps]
[视频游戏音乐]
- [喘气]

04:40.517 --> 04:42.482
Aah!
啊啊！

04:42.551 --> 04:45.724
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

04:47.586 --> 04:49.896
- Oh. That works for me.
- 哦。这对我有用。

04:49.965 --> 04:51.655
Huntsman?
猎人？

04:51.724 --> 04:52.862
- Hmm.
- 唔。

04:52.931 --> 04:55.448
- Huntsman?
- [gasps]
- 亨斯迈？
- [喘气]

04:55.517 --> 04:58.379
My Queen doth summon me!
我的女王召唤我了！

04:58.448 --> 05:01.482
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

05:06.379 --> 05:09.103
[gasping]
[喘气]

05:13.068 --> 05:15.655
You called for my personage...
mwah, mwah...
你召唤了我的人物...
呜呜呜……

05:15.724 --> 05:20.689
my most... mwah... perfectly square
Royal Highness?
我最...哇...完全方形
太子殿下？

05:20.758 --> 05:25.551
- You are to take the Prince
into the forest
- 你要带走王子
进入森林

05:25.620 --> 05:28.482
and snip off his square corners.
并剪掉他的方角。

05:28.551 --> 05:31.000
- Aah!
But, my Queen,
- 啊啊！
但是，我的女王，

05:31.068 --> 05:33.896
I could never
do something like that.
我永远不能
做类似的事情。

05:33.965 --> 05:39.862
I'm a truffle hunter,
not a sponge slicer.
我是一名松露猎人，
不是海绵切片机。

05:39.931 --> 05:40.931
- Okay then.
- 好吧。

05:41.000 --> 05:43.965
I'll cut off your corners!
我会砍掉你的棱角！

05:44.034 --> 05:47.517
- Aah! Aah! Aah!
- 啊啊！啊啊！啊啊！

05:47.586 --> 05:49.137
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

05:49.206 --> 05:51.103
Would you like
those sponge corners
你愿意吗
那些海绵角

05:51.172 --> 05:55.275
thick cut or deli sliced?
厚切还是熟食切片？

05:55.344 --> 05:57.206
- Gooooo!
- 咕咕！

05:57.275 --> 06:01.241
- Yes, my Queen!
[shrieking]
- 是的，我的女王！
[尖叫]

06:01.310 --> 06:05.206
- Even though the task
was a pain in the rump,
- 尽管任务
臀部疼痛，

06:05.275 --> 06:07.344
the Huntsman
pursued Snow Yellow...
猎人
追求黄雪……

06:07.413 --> 06:09.044
- ♪ La la la la la la la
- Like a cowardly chump.
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦
- 就像一个胆怯的笨蛋。

06:09.068 --> 06:10.482
- ♪ La la la la la la la ♪
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

06:10.551 --> 06:13.275
♪ La la la la la la
- [gasping]
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦
- [喘气]

06:13.344 --> 06:16.137
Moderate thy haste, my Prince.
节制你的匆忙，我的王子。

06:16.206 --> 06:18.896
You're frolicking too fast.
你玩得太快了

06:18.965 --> 06:21.379
I cannot keep up.
我跟不上。

06:22.793 --> 06:24.448
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

06:24.517 --> 06:28.000
Looks like someone skipped
their second breakfast.
好像有人跳过了
他们的第二份早餐。

06:28.068 --> 06:30.620
Let me look in my satchel here.
让我看看我的书包里。

06:30.689 --> 06:33.689
[menacing music]
[威胁性音乐]

06:33.758 --> 06:37.137
- [laughs darkly] [bell dings]
- [阴暗地笑] [铃声]

06:37.206 --> 06:38.206
[gasps]
- Here we go.
[喘气]
- 开始吧。

06:38.241 --> 06:39.965
A royal Krabby Patty
皇家蟹黄饼

06:40.034 --> 06:41.965
on a golden platter.
在金盘上。

06:42.034 --> 06:43.034
[angelic vocalizing]
[天使般的声音]

06:43.103 --> 06:45.793
- [groans dreamily]
- [梦幻般的呻吟]

06:45.862 --> 06:49.379
- And it's all for you.
- 这一切都是为了你。

06:49.448 --> 06:51.965
[horn blares]
- You're too kind to mutilate.
[喇叭声]
- 你太仁慈了，不会残害他人。

06:52.034 --> 06:56.206
I can't do it!
我做不到！

06:56.275 --> 06:57.103
- Oh, uh,
- 哦，呃，

06:57.172 --> 06:58.724
how about with cheese?
搭配奶酪怎么样？

06:58.793 --> 07:00.379
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
- 不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

07:02.206 --> 07:03.724
You don't understand.
你不明白。

07:03.793 --> 07:07.000
The Queen wants me
to cut off your corners
女王想要我
切断你的角落

07:07.068 --> 07:11.206
so she can be the squarest
in the land.
这样她就可以成为最方的
在这片土地上。

07:14.551 --> 07:17.448
- [screams] What?
- [尖叫] 什么？

07:17.517 --> 07:19.448
Why?
为什么？

07:19.517 --> 07:20.689
Where?
在哪里？

07:20.758 --> 07:22.103
When?
什么时候？

07:22.172 --> 07:24.448
La la la la la la la la la la!
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦！

07:24.517 --> 07:26.344
Nuh-uhhhh!
嗯嗯！

07:26.413 --> 07:29.758
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:29.827 --> 07:31.862
- Run, my sweet Prince.
- 奔跑吧，我可爱的王子。

07:31.931 --> 07:35.068
Hide in the woods
and never come back!
躲进树林里
并且永远不会回来！

07:35.137 --> 07:37.724
Leave thy Krabby Patty, though.
不过，留下你的蟹肉饼吧。

07:37.793 --> 07:39.448
Run!
跑步！

07:40.551 --> 07:42.758
[wails]
[哀号]

07:42.827 --> 07:46.344
Run!
跑步！

07:46.413 --> 07:49.034
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

07:49.103 --> 07:50.931
I don't wanna be round.
我不想变成圆的

07:51.000 --> 07:54.586
I want to stay square!
我想保持方形！

07:54.655 --> 07:56.931
[thunder crashing]
[雷霆轰鸣]

07:57.000 --> 07:58.275
[wolves howling]
What?
[狼嚎]
什么？

07:58.344 --> 07:59.551
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:59.620 --> 08:01.689
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:01.758 --> 08:02.896
Oh.
哦。

08:02.965 --> 08:04.448
Wahhh!
哇哦！

08:04.517 --> 08:07.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:10.137 --> 08:12.344
Whoa!
哇！

08:12.413 --> 08:13.896
Huh?
啊？

08:13.965 --> 08:15.034
[gasps]
[喘气]

08:15.103 --> 08:16.103
Oh, no!
哦，不！

08:16.137 --> 08:18.896
The deep dark woods!
幽深幽暗的树林！

08:18.965 --> 08:20.310
[horn honks]
Aw.
[喇叭鸣响]
噢。

08:20.379 --> 08:21.907
They're not that scary
as long as you...
他们没那么可怕
只要你...

08:21.931 --> 08:23.379
[evil laughter]
[邪恶的笑声]

08:23.448 --> 08:25.241
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:25.310 --> 08:27.344
[creatures growling,
chainsaw whirring]
[生物咆哮，
电锯呼呼地响]

08:27.413 --> 08:30.827
Aah!
啊啊！

08:30.896 --> 08:32.758
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

08:32.827 --> 08:35.448
Yaaah!
呀啊！

08:37.482 --> 08:40.241
My, what a cute little hive.
天啊，多么可爱的小蜂巢啊。

08:40.310 --> 08:42.758
Maybe I can hive in the hide.
也许我可以躲在隐蔽处。

08:42.827 --> 08:45.793
Or hide in the... hive in the...
或者躲在……蜂巢里……

08:45.862 --> 08:48.068
hide for a while.
躲一会儿。

08:48.137 --> 08:49.448
Hello?
你好？

08:49.517 --> 08:52.482
Is anybody home?
有人在家吗？

08:52.551 --> 08:54.758
I need some eyes on the inside
我需要一些观察内心的眼睛

08:54.827 --> 08:56.551
to make sure it's safe.
以确保其安全。

08:58.413 --> 09:00.206
[blows] Come on, baby.
[吹]来吧，宝贝。

09:00.275 --> 09:02.551
Papa needs a new place to live.
爸爸需要一个新的住处。

09:02.620 --> 09:03.689
Bam!
嘭！

09:05.310 --> 09:09.034
Wow, it looks like
tiny people live here.
哇，看起来像
小人物住在这里。

09:09.103 --> 09:13.482
It's so cute but such a mess.
它是如此可爱，但如此混乱。

09:13.551 --> 09:15.000
- [snarling]
- [咆哮]

09:15.068 --> 09:16.448
Ah.
啊。

09:16.517 --> 09:18.827
Mon cherie.
Ho-ho-ho.
蒙切丽。
嗬嗬嗬。

09:18.896 --> 09:20.241
- Oh, no, you don't.
- 哦，不，你不知道。

09:20.310 --> 09:22.103
I'm gonna need these.
我需要这些。

09:24.689 --> 09:25.689
[gulps]
[吞咽]

09:26.896 --> 09:30.896
Aww, seven little chairs,
each with a name.
哇，七把小椅子，
每个都有一个名字。

09:30.965 --> 09:32.793
But this place is a dump.
但这地方是个垃圾场。

09:32.862 --> 09:34.413
It's really a shame.
实在是太可惜了。

09:34.482 --> 09:36.965
It would make
a perfect hideaway.
这将使
一个完美的世外桃源。

09:37.034 --> 09:39.241
Say, maybe if I clean it,
说吧，也许如果我把它清理干净，

09:39.310 --> 09:41.034
they'll let me stay.
他们会让我留下来。

09:41.103 --> 09:42.862
Hooray!
万岁！

09:42.931 --> 09:44.448
Toilet duty!
厕所值班！

09:44.517 --> 09:47.000
♪ Now there's just one thing,
with a ring-a-ding-ding ♪
♪ 现在只有一件事，
伴随着“叮叮叮”的响声♪

09:47.068 --> 09:49.206
♪ To get in the swing
while you work, you... ♪
♪ 荡起秋千
当你工作的时候，你...♪

09:49.275 --> 09:50.379
[creatures warbling]
[生物的鸣叫]

09:50.448 --> 09:52.517
That's right... warble!
没错……颤抖！

09:52.586 --> 09:55.137
[warbling]
[颤音]

09:55.206 --> 09:56.931
[all warbling]
[全部颤抖]

09:57.000 --> 09:59.931
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

10:00.000 --> 10:01.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:01.551 --> 10:04.482
[straining]
[紧张]

10:06.551 --> 10:07.689
Oh, well.
那好吧。

10:07.758 --> 10:11.068
If it gets tough
and your energy is sapped,
如果事情变得艰难
而你的能量被耗尽，

10:11.137 --> 10:15.413
sometimes it's best
to take a nap.
有时这是最好的
小睡一下。

10:15.482 --> 10:16.758
- [laughs deviously]
- [狡猾地笑]

10:16.827 --> 10:18.862
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

10:18.931 --> 10:22.103
- "While the Prince
took a quick nappy-poo,
——“虽然王子
快速尿布便便，

10:22.172 --> 10:23.551
"the seven jellies who live
“活着的七只水母

10:23.620 --> 10:26.034
in the hive were happily
at work."
在蜂巢里快乐地
在工作中。”

10:26.103 --> 10:29.000
[jellies buzzing happily]
[果冻高兴地嗡嗡作响]

10:29.068 --> 10:36.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:40.517 --> 10:42.379
[together] ♪ We mine
flowers of the sea ♪
[一起] ♪ 我们开采
海里的花♪

10:42.448 --> 10:45.206
♪ So we can make sweet jelly ♪
♪ 这样我们就可以制作甜果冻了 ♪

10:45.275 --> 10:47.586
- ♪ And I can make me money ♪
- ♪ 我可以赚钱 ♪

10:47.655 --> 10:49.862
- ♪ This pollen
sure smells funny ♪
- ♪ 这个花粉
确实闻起来很有趣♪

10:49.931 --> 10:51.206
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

10:51.275 --> 10:52.586
[jellies buzzing happily]
[果冻高兴地嗡嗡作响]

10:52.655 --> 10:54.137
Aah!
啊啊！

10:54.206 --> 10:56.724
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:56.793 --> 10:58.379
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

10:58.448 --> 11:00.206
- Hmm?
- Meow.
- 唔？
- 喵。

11:00.275 --> 11:01.482
- Ow!
- Eek!
- 噢！
- 哎呀！

11:01.551 --> 11:02.413
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

11:02.482 --> 11:04.275
[groans]
- [laughs]
[呻吟]
- [笑]

11:05.896 --> 11:07.206
- Meow?
- Huh?
- 喵？
- 啊？

11:07.275 --> 11:08.931
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:09.000 --> 11:10.620
[clock chimes]
[钟声]

11:10.689 --> 11:13.241
- [cuckoos]
Stop working, ya morons.
- [杜鹃]
别再工作了，你们这些白痴。

11:13.310 --> 11:15.275
It's 5:00!
5:00 了！

11:15.344 --> 11:16.172
[spits]
[bell dings]
[吐口水]
[铃声]

11:16.241 --> 11:18.000
Bingo!
宾果！

11:18.068 --> 11:19.103
- Woo-hoo!
- Hurray!
- 呜呼！
- 万岁！

11:19.172 --> 11:20.379
- Whoo-hoo!
- Yahoo!
- 呼呼！
- 雅虎！

11:20.448 --> 11:22.482
- Whoo-hoo!
- Ho-ho!
- 呼呼！
- 嗬嗬！

11:22.551 --> 11:26.275
[jellies buzzing happily]
[果冻高兴地嗡嗡作响]

11:26.344 --> 11:28.724
- "When the seven jellies
got home..."
——《当七个果冻
到家了……”

11:29.758 --> 11:31.413
[alarm blares]
both: Aah!
[警报声]
两人：啊啊！

11:31.482 --> 11:32.827
- "They did not expect to find
- “他们没想到会发现

11:32.896 --> 11:35.068
a snoring monster
in their kitchen."
打鼾的怪物
在他们的厨房里。”

11:35.137 --> 11:36.896
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

11:38.931 --> 11:41.862
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

11:41.931 --> 11:43.241
- Attack!
- 攻击！

11:43.310 --> 11:44.896
All: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

11:44.965 --> 11:46.344
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

11:46.413 --> 11:48.206
[mutters dazedly]
[creatures gasp]
[茫然地嘀咕]
[生物喘息]

11:50.206 --> 11:52.896
[all gasp, groan]
[全都喘息，呻吟]

11:52.965 --> 11:54.137
- Whoo!
- 呼！

11:54.206 --> 11:56.827
How do you...
[exclaiming] Do?
你怎么...
[惊呼]做吗？

11:56.896 --> 12:00.482
You must be the owners of
this lovely little hive.
您必须是
这个可爱的小蜂巢。

12:00.551 --> 12:02.172
- That's right.
My name is...
- 这是正确的。
我的名字是...

12:02.241 --> 12:03.793
- No, don't tell me.
- 不，别告诉我。

12:03.862 --> 12:06.448
I saw your names
on your adorable little chairs.
我看到了你们的名字
在你可爱的小椅子上。

12:06.517 --> 12:08.344
Let me guess.
让我猜一下。

12:08.413 --> 12:10.413
You must be Nutty.
你一定是个疯子。

12:10.482 --> 12:11.758
- Yee-haw!
- 哎呀！

12:11.827 --> 12:13.310
You hit the bull's-eye there.
你击中了靶心。

12:13.379 --> 12:15.241
- And you're Krusty!
- 你是库斯蒂！

12:15.310 --> 12:16.655
[chimes jangle]
[钟声叮当]

12:16.724 --> 12:19.068
- Jackpot!
[chortles]
- 大奖！
[咯咯笑]

12:19.137 --> 12:20.448
- Op.
- Puffy.
- 操作。
- 浮肿。

12:20.517 --> 12:21.931
- That is correct.
- 这是正确的。

12:22.000 --> 12:23.655
- Dummy.
- 假的。

12:23.724 --> 12:24.793
- Duuuh.
- 呃。

12:24.862 --> 12:25.896
- Gimme that.
- 给我那个。

12:25.965 --> 12:26.965
Cooty.
傻瓜。

12:27.000 --> 12:28.724
- You're darn tootin'!
- 你太他妈的了！

12:28.793 --> 12:30.551
[chuckles]
[笑声]

12:30.620 --> 12:31.448
Aah!
啊啊！

12:31.517 --> 12:33.689
- Meow.
- And Gary.
- 喵。
- 还有加里。

12:33.758 --> 12:34.620
- Meow.
- 喵。

12:34.689 --> 12:36.965
- The question is, who are you?
- 问题是，你是谁？

12:37.034 --> 12:40.068
And what are you doing
in our house?
你在做什么
在我们家？

12:40.137 --> 12:42.206
- And you must be
- 你一定是

12:42.275 --> 12:43.655
Drippy.
滴水。

12:43.724 --> 12:45.344
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

12:45.413 --> 12:48.068
Nice to... [groaning]
Meet ya.
很高兴...[呻吟]
遇见你。

12:48.137 --> 12:49.586
I'm Snow Yellow.
我是雪黄

12:49.655 --> 12:52.137
[jellies gasp]
both: Snow Yellow?
[果冻喘气]
两人：雪黄？

12:52.206 --> 12:53.379
- The Prince?
- 王子？

12:53.448 --> 12:56.379
- Yes, and I'm
in a dangerous pickle.
- 是的，我是
在危险的泡菜中。

12:56.448 --> 12:58.172
It all started when...
一切都开始于……

12:58.241 --> 13:00.413
- Pickle?
- 泡菜？

13:02.931 --> 13:06.620
- It all started when...
mirror!
- 一切都开始于……
镜子！

13:06.689 --> 13:08.010
- "While the Prince tells..."
- Snip! Snip!
- “当王子告诉……”
- 剪断！剪断！

13:08.034 --> 13:10.689
- "His harrowing story
to the jellies,
- “他的悲惨故事
对于果冻来说，

13:10.758 --> 13:13.241
"the Huntsman was feeding lies
to the Queen
“猎人在撒谎
致女王

13:13.310 --> 13:15.758
"about cutting off
the Prince's corners.
“关于切断
王子的角落。

13:15.827 --> 13:18.827
And she ate it up
with great relish."
然后她就把它吃掉了
津津有味。”

13:20.655 --> 13:23.551
- Magic mirror on the wall,
- 墙上的魔镜，

13:23.620 --> 13:25.931
now who's the squarest one of...
现在谁是最方形的...

13:26.000 --> 13:27.517
- Save your breath.
- 省点口气。

13:27.586 --> 13:29.413
The Prince is still square.
太子还是方正的。

13:29.482 --> 13:30.620
- What?
- 什么？

13:30.689 --> 13:32.448
- The Huntsman is lying,
- 猎人在撒谎，

13:32.517 --> 13:34.034
if you weren't aware.
如果你不知道的话。

13:34.103 --> 13:35.310
- Lying?
- 撒谎？

13:35.379 --> 13:38.862
I have never been
so offended in my...
我从来没有去过
如此冒犯了我的...

13:38.931 --> 13:39.689
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

13:39.758 --> 13:42.275
[knives shinging]
[刀光闪闪]

13:42.344 --> 13:44.827
Uh, who are you gonna believe,
呃，你会相信谁，

13:44.896 --> 13:48.758
me or some loopy looking glass?
我还是一些疯狂的镜子？

13:48.827 --> 13:51.275
- I believe you, of course.
- 我当然相信你。

13:51.344 --> 13:52.793
- Phew.
- 唷。

13:52.862 --> 13:55.103
- I believe
you're alligator bait.
- 我相信
你是鳄鱼的诱饵。

13:55.172 --> 13:57.206
- Huh? Wah!
- 啊？哇！

13:57.275 --> 13:58.586
No! No!
不！不！

13:58.655 --> 14:00.862
[alligator chomping]
No! Aah!
[鳄鱼咀嚼]
不！啊啊！

14:00.931 --> 14:03.068
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

14:04.655 --> 14:07.344
- If you want someone cut right,
- 如果你想让某人正确，

14:07.413 --> 14:10.931
you have to cut 'em yourself.
你必须自己剪。

14:11.000 --> 14:14.586
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

14:14.655 --> 14:17.482
The Prince will
never recognize me
王子将会
永远认不出我

14:17.551 --> 14:19.758
in this wacky getup.
在这古怪的装扮中。

14:19.827 --> 14:21.206
Oop.
[laughs]
哎呀。
[笑]

14:21.275 --> 14:22.724
Uh.
呃。

14:22.793 --> 14:25.379
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

14:25.448 --> 14:26.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:26.965 --> 14:31.000
I'll dip this ball
of poison chum
我会把这个球浸入水中
毒友的

14:31.068 --> 14:35.068
in a candy coating
that no one can resist.
在糖果涂层中
无人能抗拒。

14:35.137 --> 14:38.275
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

14:38.344 --> 14:40.862
- "So Queen Karen snuck away
- “于是凯伦女王就偷偷溜走了

14:40.931 --> 14:43.758
to the seven jellies' hive
and"... ow!
到七只水母的蜂巢
以及“……噢！

14:43.827 --> 14:46.896
- I can turn
my own pages, thank you.
- 我可以转身
我自己的页面，谢谢。

14:46.965 --> 14:48.275
Ugh!
啊!

14:48.344 --> 14:51.137
[jellies buzzing happily]
[果冻高兴地嗡嗡作响]

14:51.206 --> 14:54.068
[light music]
[轻音乐]

14:54.137 --> 14:56.586
- Thanks so much for letting me
crash here a while.
- 非常感谢你让我
这里崩溃了一段时间。

14:56.655 --> 14:58.931
I'll grill jelly patties
for dinner.
我会烤果冻馅饼
吃晚饭。

14:59.000 --> 15:00.655
[all cheer]
[大家欢呼]

15:00.724 --> 15:04.206
[jellies buzzing happily]
[果冻高兴地嗡嗡作响]

15:04.275 --> 15:05.724
Goodbye. See ya tonight.
再见。今晚见。

15:05.793 --> 15:06.896
- Meow.
- Uh...
- 喵。
- 呃...

15:06.965 --> 15:08.517
[groaning]
[呻吟]

15:08.586 --> 15:10.689
I'll miss you too, Gary.
我也会想念你的，加里。

15:12.689 --> 15:13.862
- Meow-meow.
- 喵喵。

15:13.931 --> 15:15.931
♪ Mow-mow-mow, mow-mow-mow ♪
♪ 喵——喵——喵，喵——喵——喵 ♪

15:16.000 --> 15:17.965
- Peekaboo!
- [screams]
- 躲猫猫！
- [尖叫]

15:18.034 --> 15:21.827
- Hello,
my sickeningly square friend.
- 你好，
我那令人作呕的方方正正的朋友。

15:21.896 --> 15:24.551
May I use your restroom?
我可以使用你的洗手间吗？

15:24.620 --> 15:25.862
- Of course.
- 当然。

15:25.931 --> 15:28.551
I'm sure
the jellies wouldn't mind.
我确定
果冻不会介意。

15:28.620 --> 15:31.241
[humming]
[toilet flushes]
[嗡嗡声]
[厕所冲水]

15:31.310 --> 15:34.793
- I see you've made
a delicious dinner.
- 我看到你已经做到了
一顿美味的晚餐。

15:34.862 --> 15:39.137
Can I interest you
in a mouthwatering chum ball
我可以让你感兴趣吗
在令人垂涎欲滴的密友球中

15:39.206 --> 15:40.241
to go with that?
去那个？

15:40.310 --> 15:42.448
- Whoa. Eee.
- 哇哦。呃。

15:42.517 --> 15:44.275
Thank you, kind crone.
谢谢你，好心的老太婆。

15:44.344 --> 15:45.724
But I don't like chum.
但我不喜欢密友。

15:45.793 --> 15:49.344
- But my chum balls
are dipped in candy.
-但是我的好朋友
都浸在糖果里。

15:49.413 --> 15:50.448
Ooh.
哦。

15:50.517 --> 15:51.793
Num-num-num-num-num.
数-数-数-数-数。

15:51.862 --> 15:54.275
Mmm, chummy.
[giggles]
嗯，亲密。
[咯咯笑]

15:54.344 --> 15:55.896
Hey?
嘿？

15:55.965 --> 15:59.482
- Oh, I guess
a little nibble wouldn't hurt.
- 哦，我想
咬一点不会痛的。

16:04.034 --> 16:05.724
[gulps] Hey.
[吞咽]嘿。

16:05.793 --> 16:08.482
That actually
tastes pretty good.
那实际上
味道还不错。

16:08.551 --> 16:13.620
- Now you'll be
in a dehydrated sleep forever.
- 现在你会是
永远处于脱水的睡眠中。

16:13.689 --> 16:17.103
And I'll be the squarest
in the land.
我会是最正直的
在这片土地上。

16:17.172 --> 16:18.275
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

16:18.344 --> 16:20.758
- ♪ Buzz-buzz-buzz,
buzz-buzz-buzz ♪
- ♪ 嗡嗡嗡嗡，
嗡嗡嗡嗡♪

16:20.827 --> 16:23.448
Duh, forgot my pickax.
呃，忘了我的镐了。

16:23.517 --> 16:24.655
Huh?
啊？

16:24.724 --> 16:26.793
An evil witch?
邪恶的女巫？

16:26.862 --> 16:29.413
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

16:29.482 --> 16:31.620
- Duh, wait a minute.
- 呃，等一下。

16:31.689 --> 16:34.241
Pricey hairband,
昂贵的发带，

16:34.310 --> 16:36.620
removable snoot,
可拆卸束光筒，

16:36.689 --> 16:38.620
party hat?
派对帽？

16:40.655 --> 16:43.103
You're not an evil witch.
你不是邪恶的女巫。

16:43.172 --> 16:45.482
[alarm blares]
You're an evil queen!
[警报声]
你是一个邪恶的女王！

16:45.551 --> 16:47.241
- Keep quiet, you fool!
- 保持安静，你这个傻瓜！

16:47.310 --> 16:49.551
- [chomps]
- Aah! Get back here!
- [咀嚼]
- 啊啊！回到这里！

16:49.620 --> 16:52.103
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

16:52.172 --> 16:53.655
Duhhhh!
呵呵！

16:56.758 --> 16:58.448
[jellies buzzing happily]
[果冻高兴地嗡嗡作响]

16:58.517 --> 17:01.344
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

17:01.413 --> 17:02.862
[together] The Queen?
[合] 女王？

17:02.931 --> 17:05.413
- Snow Yellow is in trouble!
- 黄雪有麻烦了！

17:05.482 --> 17:07.620
- Meow!
- 喵！

17:07.689 --> 17:09.482
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, aah!
- 哇，哇，哇，啊！

17:09.551 --> 17:10.482
[all whining worriedly]
[大家都担心地抱怨]

17:10.551 --> 17:12.137
- Whoa!
- 哇！

17:12.206 --> 17:13.689
All: Snow Yellow?
全体：雪黄？

17:13.758 --> 17:14.965
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

17:15.034 --> 17:18.000
- The Queen dried him out.
- 女王把他擦干了。

17:18.068 --> 17:22.379
And I think she ate
all our jelly patties!
而且我认为她吃了
我们所有的果冻馅饼！

17:22.448 --> 17:23.896
[burps]
[打嗝]

17:23.965 --> 17:27.965
Bad Queen went that-a-way.
坏女王就是这么做的。

17:28.034 --> 17:31.655
- Let's hog-tie
that royal pain in the caboose.
- 让我们打成平手
守车里那种皇家般的痛苦。

17:31.724 --> 17:33.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:33.931 --> 17:36.482
[siren wails]
Aah!
[警报声]
啊啊！

17:36.551 --> 17:38.551
- Whoa, whoa, whoa.
- 哇，哇，哇。

17:38.620 --> 17:41.586
- I have to get away
from those jelly brains.
- 我必须离开
来自那些果冻大脑。

17:41.655 --> 17:45.172
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

17:45.241 --> 17:48.586
[all snarling]
[全都咆哮]

17:48.655 --> 17:51.137
- See ya in the next fairy tale.
- 下一个童话故事见。

17:51.206 --> 17:54.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:54.379 --> 17:56.344
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

17:56.413 --> 17:59.172
[jellies yelling angrily]
[果冻愤怒地大喊]

18:00.344 --> 18:01.620
[both roar]
[双方怒吼]

18:01.689 --> 18:03.241
- Yah!
Uh!
- 啊！
呃！

18:03.310 --> 18:05.896
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

18:05.965 --> 18:07.448
- [screaming gibberish]
- [尖叫着胡言乱语]

18:07.517 --> 18:09.586
[groans]
[呻吟]

18:10.551 --> 18:14.482
- Whoa! Whoa, magic mirror
on the wall...
- 哇！哇哦，魔镜
在墙上...

18:14.551 --> 18:15.758
- All right.
- 好的。

18:15.827 --> 18:19.724
You're the squarest...
jumpin' jellies!
你是最方的...
跳跃的果冻！

18:19.793 --> 18:21.862
- Huh?
[all snarling]
- 啊？
[全都咆哮]

18:21.931 --> 18:23.965
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

18:24.034 --> 18:27.103
Nyah! Time to hit
my escape key.
呀！击球时间
我的逃生键。

18:28.517 --> 18:30.586
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

18:30.655 --> 18:34.793
- Aah! Story time's over.
- 啊啊！故事时间结束了。

18:34.862 --> 18:36.931
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

18:37.000 --> 18:39.413
Why did I put in stairs?
我为什么要加楼梯？

18:39.482 --> 18:42.448
Ugh!
[jellies shouting indistinctly]
啊!
[果冻含糊不清地喊叫]

18:44.620 --> 18:46.793
[gasps]
[喘气]

18:46.862 --> 18:49.310
[thunder rumbles]
[whimpers]
[雷声隆隆]
[呜咽]

18:49.379 --> 18:52.034
Aah! Aah!
啊啊！啊啊！

18:52.103 --> 18:54.275
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

18:54.344 --> 18:55.724
Uh...
呃...

18:55.793 --> 18:58.620
[buzzing]
[嗡嗡声]

18:58.689 --> 19:01.862
- Gotcha.
- Uh, no.
- 明白了。
- 呃，不。

19:01.931 --> 19:05.517
I've got you!
我有你！

19:05.586 --> 19:08.793
Time to mush these jellies
into marmalade.
是时候把这些果冻捣碎了
变成果酱。

19:08.862 --> 19:10.827
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

19:10.896 --> 19:14.206
[epic music]
[史诗音乐]

19:14.275 --> 19:15.689
all: Ah!
众人：啊！

19:15.758 --> 19:18.517
- [cackles]
- [咯咯笑]

19:18.586 --> 19:20.000
Screwdrivers?
螺丝刀？

19:20.068 --> 19:22.172
Wha... what are you doing?
什……你在做什么？

19:22.241 --> 19:23.689
[jellies mumbling indistinctly]
[果冻含糊不清地咕哝]

19:23.758 --> 19:26.344
Not my screws!
不是我的螺丝！

19:29.241 --> 19:31.620
- Magic mirror off the wall,
- 墙上的魔镜，

19:31.689 --> 19:34.827
who's the fastest one of all?
谁是最快的？

19:34.896 --> 19:36.517
♪ Me ♪
♪ 我 ♪

19:36.586 --> 19:37.666
[chuckles]
[brick whistling]
[笑声]
[砖头呼啸声]

19:38.793 --> 19:40.758
Oh, great.
哦，太好了。

19:40.827 --> 19:43.413
Seven years bad luck.
七年运气不好。

19:43.482 --> 19:44.517
Ugh.
啊。

19:44.586 --> 19:46.379
- Oh!
- 哦！

19:46.448 --> 19:50.965
I was the squarest.
I was the squarest.
我是最方的。
我是最方的。

19:51.034 --> 19:54.206
Oh, what a world.
噢，多么美好的世界啊。

19:54.275 --> 19:56.068
[sobs]
[抽泣]

19:56.137 --> 20:01.241
- Well then. Cannot turn
the page now, can you?
- 那么。无法转动
现在页面可以吗？

20:01.310 --> 20:04.275
"While still under
the Queen's sleeping spell,
“虽然还在
女王的沉睡咒语，

20:04.344 --> 20:07.965
"the seven jellies placed
the Prince in a sponge dish
“七个果冻放在
海绵盘里的王子

20:08.034 --> 20:09.931
to keep him
from getting moldy."
留住他
以免发霉。”

20:10.000 --> 20:12.862
[all crying]
[都哭了]

20:12.931 --> 20:15.551
[all sobbing]
[全都抽泣]

20:15.620 --> 20:18.793
- [wails]
- [哀号]

20:18.862 --> 20:21.275
[both sob]
[两人都抽泣]

20:21.344 --> 20:24.137
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

20:24.206 --> 20:27.000
- Meow!
- 喵！

20:30.586 --> 20:32.413
- I'm ready!
- 我准备好了！

20:32.482 --> 20:34.310
All: Hooray!
全体：万岁！

20:34.379 --> 20:35.517
[all gasp in horror]
[所有人都惊恐地倒吸一口冷气]

20:35.586 --> 20:37.413
- Snow Yellow?
- 雪黄？

20:37.482 --> 20:38.931
You're still alive!
你还活着！

20:39.000 --> 20:41.793
- And naked. Eee.
- 还有裸体。呃。

20:41.862 --> 20:43.310
- I sure am.
- 我当然是。

20:43.379 --> 20:45.896
You little jellies
saved my... whoa!
你们这些小果冻
救了我的……哇！

20:45.965 --> 20:48.000
- EH, put these on, boy-o.
- 呃，穿上这些，男孩。

20:48.068 --> 20:50.068
- Oh. Thanks, Krusty.
- 哦。谢谢，库斯蒂。

20:50.137 --> 20:53.448
You little jellies
saved my sponge.
你们这些小果冻
救了我的海绵。

20:53.517 --> 20:55.275
- You're darn tootin'.
- 你太他妈的了。

20:55.344 --> 21:00.000
We took that rotten Queen
apart... bolt by bolt.
我们带走了那个腐烂的女王
分开……一点一点地分开。

21:00.068 --> 21:02.379
She won't bother you no more.
她不会再打扰你了。

21:02.448 --> 21:04.379
[laughs]
[笑]

21:04.448 --> 21:05.655
- In that case,
- 在这种情况下，

21:05.724 --> 21:07.862
you can all crash at my hive.
你们都可以冲进我的蜂巢。

21:07.931 --> 21:09.517
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

21:09.586 --> 21:11.689
all: Hooray.
全体：万岁。

21:11.758 --> 21:15.689
Aww.
[crackling]
哇。
[爆裂声]

21:15.758 --> 21:17.206
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

21:17.275 --> 21:18.586
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

21:18.655 --> 21:21.137
- [cheering]
- [欢呼]

21:21.206 --> 21:22.931
- A-one, two, three, four.
- A-一、二、三、四。

21:23.000 --> 21:24.586
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

21:24.655 --> 21:27.827
[gentle string music]
[轻柔的弦乐]

21:27.896 --> 21:35.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:36.448 --> 21:37.620
- Whoo!
- 呼！

21:37.689 --> 21:38.896
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

21:38.965 --> 21:40.344
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

21:40.413 --> 21:42.413
[together] ♪ Buzz-buzz-buzz,
buzz-buzz-buzz ♪
[一起]♪ 嗡嗡嗡嗡，
嗡嗡嗡嗡♪

21:42.482 --> 21:43.802
♪ Buzz-buzz-buzz,
buzz-buzz-buzz ♪
♪ 嗡嗡嗡嗡，
嗡嗡嗡嗡♪

21:43.862 --> 21:45.241
- Huzzah!
- 好啊！

21:45.310 --> 21:47.172
[together] ♪ Buzz-buzz-buzz
- Whoo! [laughs]
[一起]♪ 嗡嗡嗡嗡
- 呼！ [笑]

21:47.241 --> 21:49.724
[all buzzing happily]
[大家都高兴地嗡嗡作响]

21:49.793 --> 21:51.931
[together] ♪ Buzz-buzz-buzz,
buzz-buzz-buzz ♪
[一起]♪ 嗡嗡嗡嗡，
嗡嗡嗡嗡♪

21:52.000 --> 21:54.241
- [vocalizes]
- [发声]

21:54.310 --> 21:56.241
- [vomits]
- [呕吐]

21:58.310 --> 21:59.896
- [laughs]
- [笑]

21:59.965 --> 22:03.137
[cheering]
[欢呼]

22:05.034 --> 22:06.482
- Yes, indeed.
- 是的，确实如此。

22:06.551 --> 22:09.448
"And they all lived
happily ever"...
“他们都住过
永远幸福”...

22:09.517 --> 22:12.000
ow! My finger!
噢！我的手指！

22:12.068 --> 22:14.517
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

[呜咽]